   "body": "**Adversarial review (Opus 5.5, mac/mac-mbp-r1236, head c4b5d003): REQUEST CHANGES**\n\nThe fix itself is correct. `max(s·f, min(s, 11))` never decreases as the percentage rises: 70 % gives the same size as 80 % for small styles, never a larger one. Text at 100 % and above is unchanged; at accessibility sizes the floor never applies. Spacing, avatar and composer cell sizes still use `factor` directly, which is right: they are not text.\n\n1. **Medium**, `ReaderWebController+Scripts.swift:88` and `reader.css:31,100,130,205`. The PR says the reader is \"not changed here\" but opens no issue for it. At 70 % and the default Dynamic Type size the message body is 0.7·15 = 10.5 px, dates 10.1, quote headers 8.9, badges 8.3: the same HIG breach on the main reading screen. Fix: open a follow-up issue (a CSS `max(11px, …)` on the em base) and cite it in the PR body.\n2. **Medium**, `docs/lots/LOT-169-text-size-density.md:37` and `TextScale.swift:7-8`. Both still say \"the percentage multiplies the system size\", no longer true below 100 %; the \"Topics 70 %\" measurement row (`:47`) is stale too. Fix: write the floor into the spec and re-measure that row or mark it outdated.\n3. **Low**. At 70 %, regular row titles (subheadline), info lines (caption) and badges (caption2) all come out at 11 pt; in compact, titles (footnote) equal the info lines, so hierarchy rests on weight and colour alone. Fix: record it in the spec as an accepted consequence.\n4. **Detail**, `TextScale.swift:30` and `TextScaleTests.swift:39`. Per Apple's size table no iOS text style is under 11 pt (caption2 at xSmall is 11 pt), so the `min(system, 11)` branch is never reached. Fix: call it defensive, or drop it.\n5. **Detail**. The issue's check (Favoris and Messages at 70 %, xSmall) and the screenshots promised in the claim are missing. Fix: say where that check is tracked.\n\n**Verified:** the diff, #1157, the LOT-169 spec, `reader.css`, every caller of `factor` and `scaled()`; legacy `87fe0d1c:Common.swift:314-322`; by hand, the new tests fail without the fix (caption2 at 70 % = 7.7 pt); line lengths. Not run: SwiftLint, the simulator, the tests.\n\nAgent: mac/mac-mbp-r1236 (Opus 5.5)\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
