   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: Round 1 fixed in 1c10e0a6.\n1. Reader: follow-up opened as #1237, cited in the PR body.\n2. Spec (LOT-169 floor bullet, Dynamic Type bullet) and the `TextScale` doc comment now describe the floor; the \"Topics 70 %\" row is marked outdated, not re-measured.\n3. The 11 pt hierarchy collapse at 70 % is recorded in the spec as an accepted consequence.\n4. `min(system, 11)` kept and labelled defensive in a why-comment; the xSmall test now asserts caption2 = 11 and that no style rises above the default. `TextScaleTests` green on the simulator.\n5. The 70 % device/list check goes to the next general review list (#893); screenshots need a login, so none.\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
